Liu–Wang foundations: selected-source integration.

This distribution includes unchanged or explicitly recorded adaptations of
subfish-zhou/goldbach-lean. Its upstream sources include
UyNewNas/chen-theorem-lean, UyNewNas/analytic-number-theory-lean,
and AlexKontorovich/PrimeNumberTheoremAnd, as well as Mathlib.
Original per-file copyright and author notices are retained.
All newly adapted third-party sources are identified in provenance/.
The collection does not claim authorship of reused mathematical proofs.

Additional integrated or adapted sources: kimihiro64/bombieri-vinogradov,
kimihiro64/PrimeNumberTheoremAnd, kimihiro64/Robin1984,
gersh/ternary-goldbach-lean (finite circle method only), and
Mathlib RiemannZetaLogDeriv (Terence Tao). See LICENSES/ and the per-file
provenance maps. In particular, the StrongPNT file is a single-statement
extraction, not a claim that the entire upstream project is complete.
